    "name": "Connective Current",
    "slug": "connective-current-high-seas-spell-spell-2622",
    "descr": "You create a magical connection between you and an enemy, as if you were both caught in the same current. When the target takes a [move](/trait/move) action, you can [Stride](/action/stride-player-core) up to half your Speed in the same direction as the target as a reaction.\n\n---\n**Heightened (4th)** You can Stride up to your Speed.\n\n**Heightened (6th)** As 4th, and you gain an additional reaction when you [Cast this Spell](/action/cast-a-spell-player-core) and at the start of each of your turns that you can use only to make this movement.",
