    "name": "Shipwreck",
    "slug": "shipwreck-high-seas-spell-spell-2623",
    "descr": "You gesture toward a vehicle and the vessel wrenches itself apart. It must attempt a Fortitude save.\n\n**Critical Success** The vehicle is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The vehicle becomes [uncontrolled](/rule/uncontrolled-vehicles-rules-3131), and spaces within it become [difficult terrain](/rule/difficult-terrain-rules-2366).\n\n**Failure** As success, plus the vehicle gains the [broken](/condition/broken-player-core) condition. If it already had the broken condition, it’s destroyed.\n\n**Critical Failure** The vehicle is reduced to 0 HP and is destroyed.",
