    "name": "Undertow",
    "slug": "undertow-high-seas-spell-spell-2624",
    "descr": "**Area** 20-foot [burst](/rule/burst-rules-2385)\n\n---\n\nYou create an area of water 20 feet deep. The DC for Athletics checks to [Swim](/action/swim-player-core) in the area is equal to your spell DC. A creature that starts its turn in the area must attempt a Fortitude save.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature takes 2d6 bludgeoning damage.\n\n**Failure** The creature takes 4d6 bludgeoning damage and takes a –2 circumstance penalty to Athletics checks to Swim and a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its [swim Speed](/rule/swim-speed-rules-2351), if it has one, until it leaves the area.\n\n**Critical Failure** As failure, and the creature is pulled 10 feet down.",
